      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dennison%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dennison grew as a railroad village when the Minnesota and Northwestern Railroad built a line through the area in 1884, later part of Chicago Great Western.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
